  "guideShortNameAdviceTitle": "Course short-name tips",
  "guideShortNameAdviceSubtitle": "The Island supports course short names. Short names are not generated automatically, so you need to fill them in on the course edit page yourself. Keeping them within 3 characters is usually the most stable.",
  "guideShortNameRecommended": "Recommended",
